		"en": [
			"• HGUC version of the main character Victory Gundam from \"Mobile Suit V Gundam\".",
			"• Although it is small as an MS, it is reproduced with rich detail at 1/144 scale.",
			"• Enjoy high movement performance with the latest HG format.",
